      "postedAt": "2026-09-25T17:31:42.716Z",
      "text": "Today at CDIE, a group of innovators gathered for a hands-on 3D printing workshop, moving from digital design to physical prototype. Students, interns, and builders at different stages of their journeys came to learn the craft of turning a concept into something you can hold, test, and improve.\n\nWith the right tools and the talent, together we will bring Ideas to objects one layer at a time. \n\nKenyatta University Rice University The Lemelson Foundation MedTech Kenyatta University\n#InventionEducationKU #MedTechAfrica #KenyattaUniversity #3DPrinting #Prototyping #CDIE",
